1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,320
A monkey, a squirrel and a bird race to the top of a coconut tree.

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:06,079
Who will get the banana first?

3
00:00:06,379 --> 00:00:09,202
Who gets the banana? You have 10 seconds. Think!

4
00:00:18,002 --> 00:00:18,671
Nobody!

5
00:00:18,971 --> 00:00:22,659
It's a coconut tree. You won't find any bananas on it.

6
00:00:22,959 --> 00:00:26,045
Did you get it right? Follow for a new riddle every day!
